  "description": "Upgrade your vehicle with OEDRO Drop Step Running Boards, designed for durability, convenience, and style. Featuring an all-steel construction with a unique powder-coated finish, these running boards provide maximum protection against rust and corrosion. The 3.5-inch drop step offers easy access for children, the elderly, and off-road enthusiasts, making it a must-have for any truck or SUV owner.\nFeatures\nSuperior Rust Resistance: Heavy-duty carbon steel with a powder-coated finish prevents rust and corrosion, ensuring long-lasting performance.\nEasy Maintenance : The geometric plate panel minimizes mud accumulation and allows for effortless cleaning, keeping your vehicle looking sharp.\nQuick & Hassle-Free Installation : Pre-welded brackets and a bolt-on design make installation fast and simple. No cutting or drilling required.\nEnhanced Safety & Accessibility : The 3.5-inch drop step provides a stable, non-slip surface, making it easier for passengers to enter and exit the vehicle.\nHeavy-Duty Strength & Protection : Constructed from reinforced steel, these running boards offer superior support and protection for your vehicle's rocker panels.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2015-2026 Chevy Colorado/GMC Canyon Crew Cab.",
